  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Debug a Game Loop\r\n\r\nYou're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for an NPC patrol system. The AI wrote the loop that controls how the guard patrols. Run it and find the bug before shipping.\r\n\r\n**What's supposed to happen:** You're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for an NPC (Non-Player Character) patrol system. The AI wrote the loop that controls how the guard patrols. Run it and find the bug before shipping.\r\n\r\n**Your job:** Run the code and use the Debugging Checklist to find what's missing. Then fix the loop so the guard actually notices the player and stops patrolling when spotted.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
